            "label": "startup plant dynamics and branch feasibility",
            "module": "robot_learning.lab.plant_dynamics"
          }
        ],
        "rationale": "The initial direction depends on whether complete-hold failures should be pursued primarily as dynamics-aware stabilization or as branch and geometry management. This candidate-free measurement directly records loaded inertial and actuator facts, local acceleration and stopping behavior at the 20 ms control period, Jacobian conditioning, and joint-limit margins without conflating them with an unmeasured policy."
